      identify the latest matching Ubuntu 24.04 LTS image rather
      than hardcoding a single AMI ID.
    </p>

    <pre><code>data "aws_ami" "ubuntu" {
  most_recent = true

  owners = ["099720109477"]

  filter {
    name = "architecture"
    values = ["x86_64"]
  }
}</code></pre>

  </section>


